# UI juice standards (V1)

**Doctrine:** Classic Blizzard shell for process UI; brand in words (guild chat + private toasts). Research ≠ product law — design spec §10/§15 and glossary win.

Before any `CreateFrame` / toast / announce work: read `docs/superpowers/ui-polished-direction-for-agents.md`. Polish loops: `.cursor/skills/church-of-beef-dev/SKILL.md` § Polish loop (not a second skill).

## Non-negotiables

- Classic templates + opaque high-contrast + `GameFont*`; dual-encode status; class color on **names** only
- **UI ≠ points** — tabs/toasts display Core outcomes; never award standing or invent ranks
- **T0** private (suggestion / credit) = edge toast only — coalesce; no guild chat on suggestion/score/sync
- **T1** social `/g` promote announce = **deferred** (roster-backed); playtest spectacle = toast + Ladder move after guild-UI promote
- No peer echo, no multi-line liturgy, no announce on suggestion/score/sync
- Announce checkbox stays hidden until a roster-diff announcer lands
- Scarce seats = stronger **T1** copy only — never T2+/Epic / center pulses
- **V1 silent** — no SFX; missing media must not fail load
- Standing: **text thresholds** only (no hero StatusBar / HP meter)

## Motion / timing

- Prefer show/hide + short alpha on Beef-owned **insecure** frames
- **No permanent `OnUpdate`** for juice — disable scripts when idle (`wow-performance.mdc`)
- **No center-screen** alert frames / WA-style pulses for social ranks
- Stagger only inside Beef toast stack; never hitch combat
- Guest on player `uiScale` — never set `uiScale` / `UIParent:SetScale`

## Anti-patterns (reject)

WA center pulses · permanent animation directors · Details!-dense rosters · item-quality rainbow for ranks · glass/low-alpha panels · SecureActionButton for panels · tip jars · standing-as-castbar · Retail templates unverified on Anniversary · custom Media/SFX as “polish” · juice OS / tween bus

## Critique (before done)

1. Does the Ladder move when an officer promotes in the guild UI (no addon required on peers)?
2. Does this still read as Blizzard chrome if custom tint fails?
3. Can an officer open `/beef` and Dismiss / correct standing in combat without taint pain?
4. Are promote prompts honest (“guild roster”) with announce still deferred/hidden?

Harness ≠ spectacle — claim **POLISH:CANDIDATE** only; human signs PASS. See `verification.mdc`.
